X-User-Id: 1

### 순번 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/queue/bf2024/position
X-User-Id: 1

### 다른 유저 진입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/queue/bf2024/enter
X-User-Id: 2

### 다른 유저 순번 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/queue/bf2024/position
X-User-Id: 2

### 순번 조회 (토큰 포함 응답)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/queue/bf2024/position
X-User-Id: 1

### 주문 API (토큰 필요)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
X-User-Id: 1
X-Event-Id: bf2024
X-Queue-Token: {{token}}
